:"Tekma Rooks","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":962.97,"y":253.32,"cell":9953,"i":75,"name":"Duenchaumun Boars","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":966.9,"y":292.12,"cell":11424,"i":76,"name":"Sesiroft Owls","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":366.75,"y":678.84,"cell":26518,"i":77,"name":"Horapududal Badgers","tags":[],"note":"A gang of swamp brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":784.58,"y":861.99,"cell":33690,"i":78,"name":"Ya Kakalok Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༵༚་༼༬༱༅༮༃༹༥༨༦༣༡༙༒༧༬༢༯༠༯༲༢༠༶༁༰༖༘༌༾༃་༁༌༑༱༒༥༢༄༴༾༠༪༕༫༢༂༺༜༹༳༢༽༳༉༸༄༩༥༵༌༲ༀༀ༕༮༹༡༱༶༐༮༪༳༐༯༱༌༠༂༷༂༊༧་༌༼༘༨༅༑༠༐</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1118.43,"y":190.93,"cell":7528,"i":79,"name":"Nippum Idol","tags":[],"note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⳖⳃⳊⲼⳫⳤⲺⳲⳈⳎ⳪⳹⳾ⳁⲺⲺⳁ⳩⳪ⳁ⳩ⲾⳒ⳧ⳠⳆⳄⳈⳂ ⳧ⳞⳄⳢⳜⲴⲲⳜⳫ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":103.3,"y":875.76,"cell":34071,"i":80,"name":"Titoney Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༶༤༪༳༦༩༃༣༌༒༽༽༽༽༜༴༩༘༑༜༿༆༢༗༔༇༇༅༻༯༤༮ༀ༱༫༐༳༁༈༶༯༷༘༔༓༇༬༄༫༬</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":228.41,"y":541.59,"cell":21106,"i":81,"name":"Makh Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳜⲶ⳪ⲶⳌⳆⲾⳘⳬ⳩ⲶⳀⳫⳔⲲ⳥ⳔⳎⳆⳲⳐ⳹ⲶⳀⳁⲴⳲⲸⳜⳐⲸⳈⳠⳐⲾ⳪ⳊⳌⳤⳊⳖⳄⳫⲾⲲⳫⲶ ⳪ⳀⳤⳬⳆⳭⳭⳫ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":98.95,"y":143.8,"cell":5405,"i":82,"name":"Bethersbury Statue","tags":[],"note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠅𐠔\udc0f𐠟\udc2d𐠠\udc20\udc35\udc0a\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠥\udc15𐠌\udc0a\udc0d\udc2a\udc30𐠼\ud802𐠂\ud802𐠡𐠊\udc1b𐠯\udc37\udc0a\udc1b𐠿𐠋\ud802𐠋𐠁𐠜\udc17𐠘𐠣\udc11\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc1a</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1411.1,"y":466.65,"cell":18355,"i":83,"name":"Wabingdon Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc01\udc1e\udc0f\udc18𐠬\udc2e𐠑\udc05\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠥\ud802𐠪\ud802𐠘\ud802𐠖\udc13\ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc30\udc2e\udc0c\udc12\ud802\ud802𐠯\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1163.8,"y":834.48,"cell":32770,"i":84,"name":"Warghambe Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐሠዐ ተከቀየተ ጸየ ረዐበፀጠወጰመመሐሐከፐሰቀጸገፀፐበቀኀየቀሐጠገደጰመፀሀደፀ ሰለ ሀወቀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":448.3,"y":302.01,"cell":11831,"i":85,"name":"Albasiya Stele","tags":[],"note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳃⲶ⳩ⳬⲶⳒⲼ⳪⳹ⳫⲸⳀⳭⲾⳀⳜⲸⲴⳒⳚⳢ⳥⳧Ⳮ⳥Ⲻ⳾ⳎⳭ⳾⳾ⳚⳬⳈ⳥ⳞⳞⳁⲾⳔⳘ⳪ⳐⳘⳒⲼ⳥ⲲⳢⳤ⳧Ⳗ ⳄⳜⲺ ⲸⳀ⳾ⲸⳒ⳾ⳊⳫⳁⲺⳄⲼⲶⲼⳫⲼⳁⳒ⳹⳹</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1338.5,"y":429.11,"cell":16873,"i":86,"name":"Ashamish Idol","tags":[],"note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳞⳢⳜⳀ⳾ⳄⳬⳊ⳪ⳁ ⳖⳤⳜⳐ ⳾ⳆⳈ⳥ⳚⳜⳠ Ⳑ⳾ⳎⳫ⳪ⳫⳢⳜ⳩ⳄⳢ⳥⳧Ⳕ⳪Ⲵ ⳔⳀ⳾ⳌⳎ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1023.38,"y":995.48,"cell":38873,"i":87,"name":"Dunsbomer Monument","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc05\ud802𐠛\udc2d \udc2c\udc2c\udc37 \ud802𐠧\udc30𐠝𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc13\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc3c\udc02\ud802\ud802𐠙𐠅\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠔𐠝\ud802𐠈\udc11𐠠\udc2e\udc12\udc38\udc2c\udc04\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc19\udc0d\udc13\ud802 \ud802 \udc29\udc2d\udc34\udc1e</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1386.75,"y":357.99,"cell":14186,"i":88,"name":"Perskirk Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༌༲༸༄༁༐༸༾༓༔༧༪༨༶༻༰༻༛༌༬༳༼༊༲༺༈༪༂༫༳༅༭༥༫༿༕༖༨༱༒༚༙༸༣༹༿༳ༀ༓༄༤༄༤༉༸༓༰༵༈༗༴༪༮༜༲༒༼ༀ༼༃༇༕༾༣༒༑༣༾ༀ༖༜</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1147.9,"y":791.01,"cell":31053,"i":89,"name":"Tar-Eni Idol","tags":[],"note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡎᡴᡱᡴᢁᡁᢢᢂᡆᡠᡐᢓᠮᡑᡆᢂ᠐ᢋ᠒ᢠᡜᠾᢛᢋᠠᢠᡭᠨᢂᠡᡗᡠᠯᠨᠭᢤᠠᠦᡟᡏᡁᡡᡓᡝᠻᡳᢏᢟᢀᡝᢟᢤᢋᡱᢒᡀᡜᢤᢜᡡᡀᠮᠳᠻᢤᠯᡁᢥ᠐ᠧᢋᡯ᠀ᡱᢠᠩᠡᠮᡏ᠐ᠲᡑᡙᠼᡕᡖᢛᠦ᠀ᠪᢠᡡᠱᡲᡜᢡ᠒ᢒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":236.3,"y":878.12,"cell":34337,"i":90,"name":"Begore Runestone","tags":[],"note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡯᢡᡠᡎᢁᠯᡗᡗ᠒ᡱᡱᢜᡍ᠒ᠭᠦᢢᠧ᠐ᡗᠰᠡᡴᡱᡒᡆ᠑ᡲᡯᢁᡔᠪᠩᠱᠩᠦᢂᠳᢋᡒᡎᢑ᠀᠒ᡜᢁᢠᡡᢠ᠒ᢜᡴ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1499.25,"y":299.08,"cell":11754,"i":91,"name":"Calborough Stele","tags":[],"note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳐⳢⳬ⳾⳾ⲸⳂⳐⳭⳎ⳧ⲺⳢⲼⳒⳂⳊⳆⲴⳒⳠⳬⳎ⳹ⳘⳤⳒⳲⳎ⳧ⳌⳈ⳪Ⳕ⳾ⳆⳆⳤⳎⳂ⳪ⳐⲾⲾⳤⳚⳁⳤ ⳘⳌⳜⳚ ⳲⲸⲸⳒⳚ ⲸⳭ⳧ Ⲽ⳧ⲴⳂⳆⳐ⳾ⳠⳬⳎⳖⲾⲾⲸⳤⳠⳒ⳪Ⳬ⳪</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":73.82,"y":775.63,"cell":30146,"i":92,"name":"Chilbover Idol","tags":[],"note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠻᠠᡁᡐᠩᠼᡝᢡᢋᢐᢐᠱᢢᡡᠯᡑᡝᢏᠳ᠀ᢡᡔᢥᡯᡙᢡᢠᢠᢢᡴᠧᡝᢀᠿᢒᡍᠦᡖᡰᠵᠪᢜᠳᠽ᠀ᡞᠱᠡᢐᢒᡕᢠᢟᡒᢢᠨᠵᠽᡆᡡᠼᠭᢞ᠑ᡏᢥᡮᢛᢛᠵᢒᠯᠦᡆᡠᡓᢜ᠑ᡗᠡᢛᢠᠿᡯᡖᠦᡗᢑᡏᠰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":779.85,"y":960.74,"cell":37609,"i":93,"name":"Cleore Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⲴⳲⳬ⳹ⳐⳔⳤⲸⳜ ⳪ⳆⳂⳁⳒ⳾⳥⳥ ⳥ⳖⳭⳈ⳹ⲶⳊⳀ Ⲷ Ⳇ⳹ⲾⳈⳤⳌⳘⳔⳞ ⳭⲶⳆⲶⳂⲼⳖⳠⲲⳈ ⳁⳐⳊⳬⳲⳆ⳥ⳒⳆⲸⳘ ⳥ⳲⲴⳃ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":995.39,"y":468.02,"cell":18288,"i":94,"name":"Mani Column","tags":[],"note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲼⳜ⳧⳧ⳃⳔⳀⳔⲺⳜ⳾ⳢⳆ⳪ⳞⲼ⳩ⲸⳂ⳪⳧⳪Ⳡ ⳀⳊⳆⳆⳬ ⳹⳧ⳆⳀⳄⳀⲺ⳩ⳎⲼⳜⳞⲺⳒⳀⲶⳒⳐⳤⳘⳠⳞⳃⲺⳄⲲⳔ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1107.27,"y":848.51,"cell":33251,"i":95,"name":"Fomerham Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠳᡯᡭᠯᡒᡐᡱᢞᢒᡰᠭᡐᡲ᠑ᢁᢥᠼᡖᠩᡳᡗᠠᡔ᠐ᠨᡮᢀ᠒ᢞᡳᢏᡁ᠐ᡒᠳᢤᠠᡎᠦᡙ᠐ᠽᠼᢀᢦᠯᠿ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":327.24,"y":751.99,"cell":29207,"i":96,"name":"Billija Idol","tags":[],"note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነሠ ወገሠመዘረፈኀየጰአደሀነረበፐዐበ መረ ጰጸነ ደሐጠተጠጸጸ ጠጰነፐቀ ገከመጠሐ ጸከፐ ዐተ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":271.2,"y":436.91,"cell":16948,"i":97,"name":"Alsasan Monument","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc28\udc18\ud802𐠟\udc34\udc1d \udc1c𐠣\ud802 \udc0c𐠒\udc2d\udc0d\udc1d\udc22\ud802𐠡\udc2a \udc25\ud802\ud802𐠖\udc21\ud802 𐠜\ud802𐠵𐠈\udc0d𐠛\udc08\udc03𐠲\ud802 \udc17𐠍\udc22\udc1d𐠤\udc31\udc26\ud802\ud802 𐠋𐠯𐠮\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷𐠏\udc2c\udc34\udc0a\udc0d\ud802𐠛\ud802\ud802𐠚\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":555.94,"y":776.95,"cell":30223,"i":98,"name":"Elterepeki Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no o