i":216,"name":"Darham Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1084.1,"y":58.93,"cell":2377,"i":217,"name":"Salingra Cemetery","tags":[],"note":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":29.5,"y":1014.71,"cell":39449,"i":218,"name":"Oakley Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":52.51,"y":264.4,"cell":10298,"i":219,"name":"Mitfordmin Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1484.7,"y":274.32,"cell":10771,"i":220,"name":"Maltash Crypt","tags":[],"note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1514.38,"y":174.19,"cell":6856,"i":221,"name":"Berham Cemetery","tags":[],"note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":353.8,"y":90.33,"cell":3486,"i":222,"name":"Wincheskirk Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"A foreboding necropolis shrouded in perpetual darkness, where eerie whispers echo through the winding corridors and spectral guardians stand watch over the tombs of long-forgotten souls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":232.41,"y":384.67,"cell":14982,"i":223,"name":"Darham Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":176.69,"y":365.01,"cell":14238,"i":224,"name":"Bermouth Crypt","tags":[],"note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":757.73,"y":469.61,"cell":18250,"i":225,"name":"Flokhamp Cemetery","tags":[],"note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":707.03,"y":192,"cell":7462,"i":226,"name":"Yecheon Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":147.64,"y":420.75,"cell":16438,"i":227,"name":"Portsterlow Necropolis","tags":[],"note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":762.09,"y":493.93,"cell":